      "dcterms:description": "{\"action\":\"\",\"actor\":\"\",\"alternative_quotes\":[],\"applies_to\":[],\"assertion_ids\":[\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:84d82d76ae27b6c1613fc88b8fc07d746115262b66877ca1eef7efc9e0a0e220\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:17c09c38acea82aa1661b85098591cb3746e8180808ce20e5b416d96e4b6dfba\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:4a309e74f9cd6bd56c72be0215d067e49d9db4af9714cdffd2834a0e973d351b\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:62c13aad5a6b1c5d958731dbd7639cd3262d6092e529e273329fcbf1b89556cd\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:6291cc7f4f065576956bcfa047f436d3627f331827cd88e9e4a36adbcd536d1c\"],\"choice_quote\":\"\",\"choice_text\":\"\",\"claimants\":[],\"concepts\":[],\"context_quotes\":[\"(4) Before admitting the first visitor, the organizer must give the agency either a signed paper inspection record or an electronic inspection record signed by the inspecting officer. Each record must identify the display, the inspection date, and every public exit inspected.\"],\"effective_periods\":[],\"end\":2029,\"evidence\":[{\"end\":2029,\"field\":\"summary\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Acd1d2d681c56417058e5883c90b99d7d8c562af40621c5b8e3d3b614540154d5:1742:2029:sha256-7103367673d0bf063011ffb987e1452cfbb156651058333a98ee69febabca7fb\",\"quote\":\"(d) The organizer must retain each inspection record for at least 30 calendar days after the display closes. Weekends and holidays count toward the 30 days. If an investigation is open when that period ends, the organizer must retain the record until the agency closes the investigation.\",\"start\":1742},{\"end\":2029,\"field\":\"logic_text\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Acd1d2d681c56417058e5883c90b99d7d8c562af40621c5b8e3d3b614540154d5:1742:2029:sha256-7103367673d0bf063011ffb987e1452cfbb156651058333a98ee69febabca7fb\",\"quote\":\"(d) The organizer must retain each inspection record for at least 30 calendar days after the display closes. Weekends and holidays count toward the 30 days. If an investigation is open when that period ends, the organizer must retain the record until the agency closes the investigation.\",\"start\":1742},{\"end\":2029,\"field\":\"scope_text:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Acd1d2d681c56417058e5883c90b99d7d8c562af40621c5b8e3d3b614540154d5:1742:2029:sha256-7103367673d0bf063011ffb987e1452cfbb156651058333a98ee69febabca7fb\",\"quote\":\"(d) The organizer must retain each inspection record for at least 30 calendar days after the display closes. Weekends and holidays count toward the 30 days. If an investigation is open when that period ends, the organizer must retain the record until the agency closes the investigation.\",\"start\":1742},{\"end\":1032,\"field\":\"context:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3Acd1d2d681c56417058e5883c90b99d7d8c562af40621c5b8e3d3b614540154d5:756:1032:sha256-3934718a22f833f138629ffb5bab45a2b2f01847a57e012596d11a7b70c44c19\",\"quote\":\"(4) Before admitting the first visitor, the organizer must give the agency either a signed paper inspection record or an electronic inspection record signed by the inspecting officer. Each record must identify the display, the inspection date, and every public exit inspected.\",\"start\":756}],\"id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:revision:65cb70ec497c91b3faf680f3766777eaeb3a804c31ecbc79c6e3cb1ac2f1cc4f\",\"jurisdiction\":\"\",\"jurisdiction_quote\":\"\",\"kind\":\"requirement\",\"logic_text\":\"(d) The organizer must retain each inspection record for at least 30 calendar days after the display closes. Weekends and holidays count toward the 30 days. If an investigation is open when that period ends, the organizer must retain the record until the agency closes the investigation.\",\"meaning_assertion_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:6291cc7f4f065576956bcfa047f436d3627f331827cd88e9e4a36adbcd536d1c\",\"modality\":\"must\",\"modality_quote\":\"must\",\"object\":\"\",\"occurrence_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:occurrence:956dc9d3bb0a1b0c04d24dedc8681381d730cf17ffa48d91d9f746f3fd6b8802\",\"origin\":\"aiSuggested\",\"quote\":\"(d) The organizer must retain each inspection record for at least 30 calendar days after the display closes. Weekends and holidays count toward the 30 days. If an investigation is open when that period ends, the organizer must retain the record until the agency closes the investigation.\",\"references\":[],\"relation\":\"none\",\"rule_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:rule:b8650706b6035d6475122a140f235cfaeb560c0746872d36f125d95eda3024a0\",\"scope_quotes\":[\"(d) The organizer must retain each inspection record for at least 30 calendar days after the display closes. Weekends and holidays count toward the 30 days. If an investigation is open when that period ends, the organizer must retain the record until the agency closes the investigation.\"],\"scope_text\":\"After the display closes, if an investigation is open when the 30-calendar-day period ends\",\"section_id\":\"section-1\",\"start\":1742,\"summary\":\"If an investigation is open when the 30-calendar-day retention period ends, the organizer must retain the inspection record until the agency closes the investigation.\",\"target_ids\":[],\"typed_values\":[]}",
